Simon: I heard you were leaving.
catherine: Yes I am, word travels quickly here.
- Thank Simon
	catherine: Thank you, Simon.
	Simon: For what do you thank me for?
	catherine: For speaking honestly with me.
	Simon: You may find that honesty is easier when one has nothing left to lose.
	Simon: Take care of yourself, Catherine.
	leave Simon [animation="Fade In" length="1.0" wait="true"]
