- Say you regret coming
	catherine: Sometimes I wish I'd never found this place.
	Simon: Yet here you are. Regret cannot return you to the person you were before you came here.
	catherine: Yes. I know.
	Simon: Then perhaps it is better to leave knowing what you know now.
	catherine: That is a really bleak way to put it
	Simon: It isn’t my story, you take what you can from it.
	leave Simon [animation="Fade In" length="1.0" wait="true"]
	[background arg="res://assets/backgrounds/BlackBaground.png" fade="1.0" wait="true"]
	set {ChapterTracking.is_evil} = true
